{:edb/db-before-t 10056 :edb/db-after-t 10057 :edb/tx-data [[13194139543369 50 #inst "2026-10-28T18:04:49.903Z" 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186053451 1078 #edb/ref 17592186053452 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186053811 1078 #edb/ref 17592186053816 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186053817 1078 #edb/ref 17592186053819 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186055369 1074 "The line has slope $2$ and vertical intercept $-4$. It passes through $(0,-4)$ and $(2,0)$, so choose the graph with these intercepts and positive slope $2$." 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186055429 1074 "Substituting $x=0,1,2,3$ into $y=-x+1$ gives $y=1,0,-1,-2$. The required graph passes through these four points and slopes downward." 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186055430 1074 "The equation $y=\\frac12x-2$ has vertical intercept $-2$ and horizontal intercept $4$. Choose the line through $(0,-2)$ and $(4,0)$." 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186056508 1078 #edb/ref 17592186056513 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186056526 1078 #edb/ref 17592186056527 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186056604 1078 #edb/ref 17592186056609 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186056640 1078 #edb/ref 17592186056644 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186056784 1078 #edb/ref 17592186056787 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186056790 1078 #edb/ref 17592186056795 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186057066 1078 #edb/ref 17592186057068 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186057102 1078 #edb/ref 17592186057103 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186057108 1078 #edb/ref 17592186057113 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186057618 1078 #edb/ref 17592186057623 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186057998 1078 #edb/ref 17592186057999 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186058680 1078 #edb/ref 17592186058684 13194139543369 17592186576411 true] [17592186058686 1078 #edb/ref 175921